    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1530">

                <pb facs="1242" n="1126" sameAs="frus:frus1912/pg1126"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 033.1100 K77/95.]</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The President of Nicaragua to
                        the President</hi>.</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Presidential Mansion</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Managua</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1912-03-07">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">March 7, 1912</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>I have the honor to apprize you of enthusiastic ovation for Secretary Knox and
                    family. Nicaragua considers herself honored by the visit of such illustrious and
                    welcome guests, and I take pleasure in thanking Your Excellency for it. I send
                    you my best wishes for your personal happiness and for the prosperity of the
                    American people over whom Your Excellency so worthily presides.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">President Díaz</hi>.</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
